#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:1
msgid "E0031"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unused_optional_argument`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:5
msgid ""
"The optional argument is never supplied. If the optional argument is "
"never supplied, then it can be safely removed from the parameter list and"
" be used purely internally as a normal variable."
msgstr "可选参数从未被提供。如果可选参数从未被提供，那么它可以安全地从参数列表中移除，并作为普通变量纯粹在内部使用。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:11
msgid ""
"This warning is turned off by default. Enable it with the `warnings` "
"field in `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "此警告默认关闭。请通过 `moon.pkg` 中的 `warnings` 字段启用它："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:14
msgid "moon.pkg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:14
msgid ""
"warnings = \"+unused_optional_argument\"\n"
"\n"
"pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:19
msgid "main.mbt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:19
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn f(opt? : Int = 4) -> Int {\n"
"  ignore(opt)\n"
"  0\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"fn main {\n"
"  println(f())\n"
"  println(f())\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:24
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:26
msgid ""
"You can remove the optional argument, and use a local variable definition"
" instead:"
msgstr "你可以移除可选参数，并使用局部变量定义代替："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0031.md:29
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn f() -> Int {\n"
"  let opt = 4\n"
"  ignore(opt)\n"
"  0\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"fn main {\n"
"  println(f())\n"
"  println(f())\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

